                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.001/3.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of the United States to Madame
                        Caceres.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The White House</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-11-20"><hi rendition="#italic">November 20,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Please accept my heartfelt sympathies in your great affliction.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm H. Taft.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
